rworldly forces wielding magic. Lead the resistance against the oppressors in this fantasy turn-based strategy game to save humanity from becoming the Slaves of Magic!","steam_appid":1442610,"support_info":{"email":"slaveofmagicthegame+steamstore@gmail.com","url":"https://www.indiedb.com/games/slaves-of-magic"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.indiedb.com/games/slaves-of-magic"}